L1: Excessive Vitamin E Supplementation: Implications for Ovarian Physiology and Reproductive Health
L2: Oxidative Medicine and Cellular Longevity (2026)
L3: Farzaneh Rabiee, Masoud Fattahi, Mohammad Iranzad, Mohsen Rahimi Andani, Farnoosh Jafarpour, Mohammad Hossein Sanei, Joel R. Drevet, Mohammad Hossein Nasr-Esfahani
